+ * The last assistant turn is the only acceptable source: its request carried
+ * every message before it with this chain's own system prompt and tools, so the
+ * attested number covers exactly the prefix the summarize request re-sends and
+ * only the messages from that index on have to be estimated. A usage from an
+ * earlier turn would leave the turns after it -- opaque reasoning payloads
+ * included -- to the local estimator, which cannot size them; such a chain is
+ * refused by name (`capacity-unattested`) rather than guessed at. The same api
+ * and model must have sized it, or the number is not a measure of this request.
